  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed for both physical deceleration (vehicles, machinery) and figurative slowdowns (economic growth, project progress). The opposite is {加速|かそく} (acceleration).\n\nNot to be confused with the homophone {原則|げんそく} (principle, general rule).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {減速|げんそく}する: to decelerate, to slow down\n- {急|きゅう}{減速|げんそく}: sudden deceleration\n- {経済|けいざい}の{減速|げんそく}: economic slowdown\n- {減速|げんそく}{車線|しゃせん}: deceleration lane",
